 "gain": 0.28,
 "notes": "Vibraphone with soft mallets, no motor tremolo, bars left ringing, velocity layer 2 of 2, stereo. 11 notes F3-E6 every 3-4 semitones (the full 3-octave range). Natural decay trimmed to 6 s; the release time models the damper pedal (0.4-0.8 s sounds natural). The engine can add a slow amplitude tremolo (~5 Hz) for a motor-on sound."
